SUMMARY:Panthers' in the Know: Primary Election Edition
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Panthers in the Know\, the Online Civic Trivia Pro
 gram from PCC's Office of Civic Leadership Development!The ballots for Or
 egon's Primary Election have been mailed out to regisered voters. Take ou
 r trivia challenge to learn more about the Primary election and make sure
  to submit your ballot by the May 19th deadline.By participating\, you wi
 ll automatically be entered into a drawing to win one of five $25 Amazon 
 gift cards. You can earn an extra entry by responding to our "Tell us wha
 t you think" prompt.Trivia entries are due by Saturday\, May 23rd—Event
  Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383168 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id
 =383168)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Welcome to Panthers in the Know\, the Online
  Civic Trivia Program from PCC's Office of Civic Leadership Development!<
 br />The ballots for Oregon's Primary Election have been mailed out to re
 gisered voters. Take our trivia challenge to learn more about the Primary
  election and make sure to submit your ballot by the May 19th deadline.<b
 r />By participating\, you will automatically be entered into a drawing t
 o win one of five $25 Amazon gift cards. You can earn an extra entry by r
 esponding to our "Tell us what you think" prompt.<br />Trivia entries are
  due by Saturday\, May 23rd<br />—<br />Event Details: <a href="https:/
 /hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383168" target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=
 383168</a>
