BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260523
SUMMARY:Take the Survey! 💻 Share Your Thoughts About Online Classes
DESCRIPTION:We want to hear from online learners like you!Did you know th
 at students who take online classes are the "new majority" at PCC? Approx
 imately 70% of all PCC students enroll in at least one online class each 
 term\, and 1 out of every 3 students take all of their courses online. In
  Spring term alone\, there are ~13\,000 online students at PCC!As the num
 ber of online students continues to grow\, Online Learning wants to know 
 more about what we are doing well and where we can improve. We invite you
  to share your experience by completing an easy online survey.The Online 
 Learning team will use the student responses we receive to shape the futu
 re of online education at PCC. It is important for us to hear from as man
 y online students as possible\, and we hope you take some time to share y
 our candid thoughts!Complete the Survey: https://survey.ruffalonl.com/#/e
 ntry/sample/sps/6874/54739 (https://survey.ruffalonl.com/#/entry/sample/s
 ps/6874/54739)You will need approximately 10-15 minutes to complete the s
 urvey. Before accessing the survey\, you will be asked to enter your PCC 
 email address (e.g. poppie.panther@pcc.edu) as the Passcode to verify you
 r student status.Your participation in this survey is completely voluntar
 y\, and your responses will be kept confidential. If you have any questio
 ns about the survey\, feel free to reach out to the Online Student Suppor
 t and Engagement Coordinator\, Morgan Freking (morgan.freking@pcc.edu).Yo
 ur Participation = Entry for Raffle Prizes!As a thank you for your time a
 nd insight\, all students who complete the survey will be entered into a 
 raffle to win some prizes! You could be one of 13 students who will be se
 lected to receive the following:Grand Prize: a MacBook Neo1st Prize: your
  choice between an Apple Watch SE 3 or FitBit Sense 22nd Prize: your choi
 ce between an Apple AirPods (with Active Noise Cancellation) or Bose Quie
 tComfort earbuds3rd Prize: one of ten $50 Visa gift cardsTHIS WEEK ONLY! 
 Early Bird Raffle PrizesIf you complete the survey in the first week\, yo
 u will also be entered into an Early Bird raffle for six additional prize
 s! Finish the survey by Sunday\, May 17 at 11:59 pm PDT and you will auto
 matically be entered into the Early Bird drawing.Early Bird 1st Prize: yo
 ur choice of an Apple iPad (with Apple Pencil) or reMarkable 2Early Bird 
 2nd Prize: one of five $50 Visa gift cardsWe greatly appreciate your time
  and participation!Sincerely\,Erica GreenDean of Online LearningGloria Br
 yantOnline Student Services ManagerMorgan FrekingOnline Student Support a
 nd Engagement CoordinatorMeeting Link: https://survey.ruffalonl.com/#/ent
 ry/passcode/sps/6874/54739 (https://survey.ruffalonl.com/#/entry/passcode
 /sps/6874/54739)—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383149 (htt
 ps://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383149)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:We want to hear from online learners like yo
 u!<br />Did you know that students who take online classes are the "new m
 ajority" at PCC? Approximately 70% of all PCC students enroll in at least
  one online class each term\, and 1 out of every 3 students take all of t
 heir courses online. In Spring term alone\, there are ~13\,000 online stu
 dents at PCC!<br />As the number of online students continues to grow\, O
 nline Learning wants to know more about what we are doing well and where 
 we can improve. We invite you to share your experience by completing an e
 asy online survey.<br />The Online Learning team will use the student res
 ponses we receive to shape the future of online education at PCC. It is i
 mportant for us to hear from as many online students as possible\, and we
  hope you take some time to share your candid thoughts!<br />Complete the
  Survey: <a href="https://survey.ruffalonl.com/#/entry/sample/sps/6874/54
 739" target="_blank">https://survey.ruffalonl.com/#/entry/sample/sps/6874
 /54739</a><br />You will need approximately 10-15 minutes to complete the
  survey. Before accessing the survey\, you will be asked to enter your PC
 C email address (e.g. poppie.panther@pcc.edu) as the Passcode to verify y
 our student status.<br />Your participation in this survey is completely 
 voluntary\, and your responses will be kept confidential. If you have any
  questions about the survey\, feel free to reach out to the Online Studen
 t Support and Engagement Coordinator\, Morgan Freking (morgan.freking@pcc
 .edu).<br />Your Participation = Entry for Raffle Prizes!<br />As a thank
  you for your time and insight\, all students who complete the survey wil
 l be entered into a raffle to win some prizes! You could be one of 13 stu
 dents who will be selected to receive the following:<br />Grand Prize: a 
 MacBook Neo<br />1st Prize: your choice between an Apple Watch SE 3 or Fi
 tBit Sense 2<br />2nd Prize: your choice between an Apple AirPods (with A
 ctive Noise Cancellation) or Bose QuietComfort earbuds<br />3rd Prize: on
 e of ten $50 Visa gift cards<br />THIS WEEK ONLY! Early Bird Raffle Prize
 s<br />If you complete the survey in the first week\, you will also be en
 tered into an Early Bird raffle for six additional prizes! Finish the sur
 vey by Sunday\, May 17 at 11:59 pm PDT and you will automatically be ente
 red into the Early Bird drawing.<br />Early Bird 1st Prize: your choice o
 f an Apple iPad (with Apple Pencil) or reMarkable 2<br />Early Bird 2nd P
 rize: one of five $50 Visa gift cards<br />We greatly appreciate your tim
 e and participation!<br />Sincerely\,<br />Erica Green<br />Dean of Onlin
 e Learning<br />Gloria Bryant<br />Online Student Services Manager<br />M
 organ Freking<br />Online Student Support and Engagement Coordinator<br /
 >Meeting Link: <a href="https://survey.ruffalonl.com/#/entry/passcode/sps
 /6874/54739" target="_blank">https://survey.ruffalonl.com/#/entry/passcod
 e/sps/6874/54739</a><br />—<br />Event Details: <a href="https://hub.pc
 c.edu/rsvp?id=383149" target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383149<
 /a>
