SUMMARY:Matcha Monday Menstruation Matters
DESCRIPTION:Join the RC WRC to discuss Menstruations topics. Health aware
 ness\,Reducing stigmaAcademic impact: Severe cramps\, fatigue\, migraines
 \, or heavy bleeding can affect attendance\, concentration\, sports parti
 cipation\, and exam performance.lack of access to menstrual products\,Inc
 lusivity and equity: Menstruation conversations support not only women\, 
 but also transgender and nonbinary students who menstruate. Sharing is op
 tional\, judgment free zone.—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id
 =383141 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383141)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Join the RC WRC to discuss Menstruations top
 ics. Health awareness\,<br />Reducing stigma<br />Academic impact: Severe
  cramps\, fatigue\, migraines\, or heavy bleeding can affect attendance\,
  concentration\, sports participation\, and exam performance.<br />lack o
 f access to menstrual products\,Inclusivity and equity: Menstruation conv
 ersations support not only women\, but also transgender and nonbinary stu
 dents who menstruate. Sharing is optional\, judgment free zone.<br />—<
 br />Event Details: <a href="https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383141" target="
 _blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383141</a>
