SUMMARY:Career Planning 101: Choosing a Major/Career
DESCRIPTION:Almost 50% of first-time college students are undecided on a 
 major\, and up to 80% of students change their major at least once. Wheth
 er you're just starting along your academic path and unsure how to select
  a major\, or you're ready to make a career-pivot\, planning your future 
 can feel like a big decision.Luckily\, the PCC Career Services team is he
 re to help you learn the process with a workshop designed just for you. W
 e'll cover everything from the purpose of taking career-assessments to ho
 w best to research a major. And we'll go over valuable tools\, services\,
  and techniques available to PCC students.Plus\, we'll take time for a Q&
 amp\;A-session\, so you get the opportunity to speak directly with Career
  Services staff.We hope to see you there!To request an accommodation\, pl
 ease contact cap@pcc.edu four days before the event.Meeting Link: https:/
 /portlandcc.zoom.us/meeting/register/75SimLpfRnSa8ENJcB2yWg (https://port
 landcc.zoom.us/meeting/register/75SimLpfRnSa8ENJcB2yWg)—Event Details: 
 https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382663 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382663)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Almost 50% of first-time college students ar
 e undecided on a major\, and up to 80% of students change their major at 
 least once. Whether you're just starting along your academic path and uns
 ure how to select a major\, or you're ready to make a career-pivot\, plan
 ning your future can feel like a big decision.<br />Luckily\, the PCC Car
 eer Services team is here to help you learn the process with a workshop d
 esigned just for you. We'll cover everything from the purpose of taking c
 areer-assessments to how best to research a major. And we'll go over valu
 able tools\, services\, and techniques available to PCC students.<br />Pl
 us\, we'll take time for a Q&amp\;A-session\, so you get the opportunity 
 to speak directly with Career Services staff.<br />We hope to see you the
 re!<br />To request an accommodation\, please contact cap@pcc.edu four da
 ys before the event.<br />Meeting Link: <a href="https://portlandcc.zoom.
 us/meeting/register/75SimLpfRnSa8ENJcB2yWg" target="_blank">https://portl
 andcc.zoom.us/meeting/register/75SimLpfRnSa8ENJcB2yWg</a><br />—<br />E
 vent Details: <a href="https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382663" target="_blank
