SUMMARY:Share Your Voice: 82nd Avenue Transit Project
DESCRIPTION:PCC Community: Help Shape the Future of 82nd Avenue!The Civic
  Leadership Development (CLD) team at PCC would like to hear about your e
 xperiences living and commuting along 82nd Avenue!The 82nd Avenue Transit
  Project aims to bring a faster\, more reliable bus line (FX) to 82nd Ave
 nue\, connecting Clackamas Town Center to the Cully neighborhood. The goa
 l is to shorten travel times and improve connections to MAX and other bus
  lines.Your input will help make sure these improvements reflect the need
 s of the PCC community\, neighbors along 82nd Avenue\, and the broader co
 mmunity. We will share your feedback with TriMet and relevant campus part
 ners.We appreciate you taking the time to share your thoughts!If you have
  any questions\, please reach out to: cld-group@pcc.edu__________________
 ____________________________If you'd like to attend an in-person meeting 
 for the project:Wednesday\, May 27\, 6–7:30 p.m.PCC SE Community Hall A
 nnex2305 SE 82nd Ave.\, PortlandThe location is northwest of the Library.
  See the map at pcc.edu. Parking at PCC requires a parking permit. Learn 
 more at pcc.edu.https://trimet.org/82nd/cac.htm#meeting (https://trimet.o
 rg/82nd/cac.htm#meeting)—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383
 195 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383195)
