 ness\,Reducing stigmaAcademic impact: Severe cramps\, fatigue\, migraines
 \, or heavy bleeding can affect attendance\, concentration\, sports parti
 cipation\, and exam performance.lack of access to menstrual products\,Inc
 lusivity and equity: Menstruation conversations support not only women\, 
 but also transgender and nonbinary students who menstruate. Sharing is op
 tional\, judgment free zone.—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id
