SUMMARY:Red Cross Blood Drive PCC Southeast
DESCRIPTION:Summer is the season for celebrating — festivals\, parades\
 , cookouts\, beach trips and everything in between. For patients in need\
 , summer celebrations start with you!The American Red Cross is partnering
  with PCC's Office of Civic Leadership Development to host a blood drive 
 at the PCC Southeast Campus.The drive will be held on Tuesday\, June 2nd\
 , in the Mt. Tabor Great Hall from 10:00am to 3:00pm. Save your spot by g
 oing to https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/find-drive (https://www.r
 edcrossblood.org/give.html/find-drive) and enter in sponsor code PCC SEYo
 u can save time onsite by entering information through the Red Cross Rapi
 d Pass.Give blood\, platelets or AB Elite plasma June 1-28\, 2026\, and t
 he American Red Cross will say thanks with a $15 e-gift card to the merch
 ant of your choice.* Plus\, you'll automatically be entered for a chance 
 to win one of two $7\,500 gift cards!^^ Amplify your summer fun\, on us!S
 tart Summer by donating blood\, platelet or AB Elite plasma and saving a 
 life today!—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383198 (https://
 hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383198)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Summer is the season for celebrating — fes
 tivals\, parades\, cookouts\, beach trips and everything in between. For 
 patients in need\, summer celebrations start with you!<br />The American 
