  to host a blood drive at the PCC Southeast Campus.<br />The drive will b
 e held on Tuesday\, June 2nd\, in the Mt. Tabor Great Hall from 10:00am t
 o 3:00pm. Save your spot by going to <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.o
 rg/give.html/find-drive" target="_blank">https://www.redcrossblood.org/gi
 ve.html/find-drive</a> and enter in sponsor code PCC SE<br />You can save
  time onsite by entering information through the Red Cross Rapid Pass.<br
  />Give blood\, platelets or AB Elite plasma June 1-28\, 2026\, and the A
 merican Red Cross will say thanks with a $15 e-gift card to the merchant 
 of your choice.* Plus\, you'll automatically be entered for a chance to w
 in one of two $7\,500 gift cards!^^ Amplify your summer fun\, on us!<br /
