DESCRIPTION:Come join us at Sylvania's Verterans Resource Center for our 
 weekly movie viewing! Because college students are typically short on cas
 h\, this term we will be exploring where and how you might be able to fin
 d movies and media to watch legally for low/no cost. The options that are
  out there may surprise you and help you find movies you hadn't thought t
 o watch before!—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383000 (http
 s://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=383000)
