SUMMARY:Reel Access: Disability on Screen
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Accessibility Hub on PCC's Southeast Campus ev
 ery Thursday at 1:00 PM for movie day! We'll watch and discuss films that
  focus on disability and the amazing lives and accomplishments of people 
 with disabilities. SE Mount Tabor Hall\, room 136. Come for the popcorn\,
  stay for the movie!We'll watch:Code of the Freaks (4/23)The Reason I Jum
 p (4/30)Margarita with a Straw (5/7)Murderball (5/14)Your Friend\, Memphi
 s (5/21)Defiant Lives (5/28)Invitation to Dance (6/4)Including Samuel + s
 hort film Ramped Up (6/11)—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=3
 82881 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382881)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Join us in the Accessibility Hub on PCC's So
 utheast Campus every Thursday at 1:00 PM for movie day! We'll watch and d
 iscuss films that focus on disability and the amazing lives and accomplis
 hments of people with disabilities. SE Mount Tabor Hall\, room 136. Come 
 for the popcorn\, stay for the movie!<br />We'll watch:<br />Code of the 
 Freaks (4/23)<br />The Reason I Jump (4/30)<br />Margarita with a Straw (
 5/7)<br />Murderball (5/14)<br />Your Friend\, Memphis (5/21)<br />Defian
